      "title": "What the switch does",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "OFF (default) = pure text-to-image.\n\nON = the loaded image is passed to the text encoder as a reference, AND the sampler takes its latent size from Text Encode Qwen Image 2.1 instead of Empty Latent Image.\n\nSo while the switch is ON the aspect ratio picker has no effect -- output size follows the reference image and the Reference resolution widget."
      ],
